WEBVTT

00:07:59.933 --> 00:08:00.951
"The Tempest."

00:08:00.975 --> 00:08:05.044
It's a movie. I did "The
Tempest" on a stage three times

00:08:05.068 --> 00:08:08.281
in the theater since 1984, '86,

00:08:08.305 --> 00:08:10.485
and I love the play.

00:08:10.509 --> 00:08:13.011
I did it always with a male Prospero.

00:08:13.035 --> 00:08:14.673
And all of a sudden, I thought,

00:08:14.697 --> 00:08:16.759
"Well, who am I gonna
get to play Prospero?

00:08:16.783 --> 00:08:20.481
Why not Helen Mirren?
She's a great actor. Why not?"

00:08:20.505 --> 00:08:23.741
And this material really did work
for a woman equally as well.

00:08:23.765 --> 00:08:26.836
So now, let's take a look
at some of the images

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:28.829
from "The Tempest."

00:08:28.853 --> 00:08:33.836
(Music)